&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strategic Planning &amp;amp; Agenda Management&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage the executive&#39;s agendas for staff meetings, operating reviews, product and engineering forums, and leadership offsites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, frame, and prioritize key topics and decisions to ensure meetings are outcome-oriented and aligned with strategic goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate upcoming decisions and proactively surface risks, tradeoffs, and dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Business &amp;amp; Operating Cadence Coordination&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, maintain, and continuously improve business and operating cadences across product and engineering (e.g., weekly staff meetings, quarterly planning, roadmap reviews, and retrospectives).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate inputs, pre-reads, and outputs across teams to ensure consistent, high-quality execution of these cadences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;OKR &amp;amp; Performance Management&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
