&lt;li&gt;Drive accountability by following up on underperforming or at-risk initiatives and facilitating course correction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Follow-Through&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture key decisions and action items from executive and leadership meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure clear ownership, deadlines, and visibility for all critical action items.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track execution and proactively intervene to remove blockers or escalate issues when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Special Projects &amp;amp; Strategic Initiatives&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or support high-priority, cross-functional initiatives on behalf of the executive office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct analysis, develop recommendations, and drive execution on strategic projects related to product strategy, engineering execution, or organizational effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted thought partner to the leadership on organizational design, prioritization, and scaling challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
