&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Corporate Development Associate&lt;/strong&gt; will support our &lt;strong&gt;Equity Capital Markets (ECM) and Investor Relations (IR)&lt;/strong&gt; efforts as we continue to scale as a public company. This role will be instrumental in executing equity-related capital markets activity, supporting investor engagement, and partnering closely with Finance, Legal, and executive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate brings strong experience from an investment banking background, thrives in a fast-paced environment, and is excited to help build and scale best-in-class capital markets and investor relations processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
