&lt;li&gt;Support ongoing engagement with &lt;strong&gt;sell-side and buy-side analysts&lt;/strong&gt;, including preparation of key messaging, materials, coordination of meetings, regular direct dialogue, and follow-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage the &lt;strong&gt;corporate access calendar&lt;/strong&gt;, including investor meetings, conferences, roadshows, and non-deal roadshows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a key role in the &lt;strong&gt;quarterly earnings process&lt;/strong&gt;, including preparation of earnings materials, scripts, Q&amp;amp;A, and coordination across teams&lt;/li&gt;
