&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Director of Developer Relations builds, engages, and grows a technical community around the CoreWeave SaaS offerings, including tools from Weights &amp;amp; Biases, OpenPipe, and Marimo. They act as the bridge between developers and internal teams by translating product capabilities into compelling technical narratives and channeling community feedback back into engineering and product teams. The team thinks big about new and creative ways to engage AI engineers and developers. Our goal is to help AI researchers, developers, and builders create models and self-improving AI agents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are hiring a Director of Developer Relations reporting to the Head of Product and Content Marketing, Weights &amp;amp; BIases. We’re looking for a candidate who thrives in a fast-paced environment and collaborates well across teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and execute the developer relations strategy&lt;/strong&gt; to drive awareness and adoption of CoreWeave’s SaaS offerings among AI engineers, researchers, and developers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as a hands-on technical advocate&lt;/strong&gt;, producing high-impact content including onboarding guides, tutorials, demos, reference architectures, blog posts, and code samples that accelerate time-to-first-value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and continuously improve the developer onboarding experience&lt;/strong&gt;, identifying friction in documentation, APIs, SDKs, and workflows, and partnering with product and engineering to streamline adoption.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and engage the developer community&lt;/strong&gt; through events, workshops, hackathons, online forums, and ecosystem partnerships, serving as a credible voice in the AI community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish a strong feedback loop and measure impact&lt;/strong&gt;, synthesizing community insights for internal teams and tracking metrics such as onboarding conversion, product adoption, engagement, and retention.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills to report on success of developer programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Self-driven and proactive to find ways to improve processes and collaborate with team members&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience leading a team of developer advocates and evangelists&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
