&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Director of Product Marketing to define and drive the go-to-market strategy, positioning, and storytelling for CoreWeave&#39;s Agentic AI platform. This is a highly visible, high-impact leadership role at the center of one of the fastest-evolving categories in AI — helping the world&#39;s most ambitious builders understand why CoreWeave is the essential infrastructure for deploying, scaling, and operationalizing agentic AI systems. You&#39;ll shape how we position CoreWeave&#39;s inference capabilities, platform tooling, and underlying compute for agentic workloads, and partner closely with product, sales, and field marketing to turn that narrative into campaigns, sales plays, and customer proof points that drive adoption and pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Positioning, Messaging &amp;amp; Narrative Development&lt;/p&gt;
