&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead the development of CoreWeave&#39;s positioning as the premier infrastructure platform for agentic AI, spanning inference, orchestration, and developer tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Create messaging frameworks and audience-specific value propositions targeting AI Leaders, ML Platform Engineers, CTOs, AI Engineers, and AI Researchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build compelling narratives around CoreWeave&#39;s core differentiation for agentic workloads: high-throughput multi-model inference, low-latency serving, persistent storage for long-horizon tasks, and network fabric optimized for agent pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Translate technical platform capabilities into accessible stories anchored in real customer outcomes and business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Go-to-Market &amp;amp; Sales Enablement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Design and execute go-to-market programs targeting AI-native companies, enterprises, and leading research labs building and deploying agentic AI systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build and maintain use-case playbooks aligned to the highest-value agentic workloads: autonomous coding agents, multi-agent reasoning pipelines, AI-powered automation, and real-time decision systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop sales enablement materials — first-call decks, competitive battlecards, and executive narratives — equipping field sellers to lead technical and strategic conversations with AI buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner with demand generation to define campaign strategy, measure pipeline influence, and optimize for target account penetration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Support major event activations including Fully Connected, NVIDIA GTC, NeurIPS, AI Engineer World&#39;s Fair, and MLCommons benchmarking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Ecosystem &amp;amp; Partner GTM&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build and execute joint GTM programs with key partners in the agentic AI ecosystem: agent framework providers, model providers, and complementary AI tooling companies&lt;/li&gt;
