&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Conduct ongoing market, competitor, and customer research to identify emerging agentic AI infrastructure requirements and GTM opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Synthesize insights from customer conversations, POCs, and deployments to inform product roadmap priorities and go-to-market strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Track the evolving agentic AI landscape — new model capabilities, agent frameworks, and enterprise adoption patterns — and translate findings into actionable positioning updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
