&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the function end to end:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide strategic leadership over the technical, operational, and reporting activities supporting CoreWeave’s global data center operations — owning the accounting and month-end close for supply chain and inventory valuation, standard cost and absorption, fixed assets and capital project accounting (CIP), GRIR management, freight and logistics, and procure-to-pay (P2P).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish the long-term vision:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and drive a scalable operational accounting framework, including systems, workflows, and organizational design capable of sustaining hyper-growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and operate the control environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute a robust, SOX-compliant (or equivalent) control environment across operational and technical accounting processes, driving clean audits and year-over-year reductions in findings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead technical &amp;amp; judgment-heavy accounting:&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate, document, and implement accounting treatment for complex transactions in partnership with Technical Accounting and Controllership. Support the accounting review and ongoing management of long-term supplier and commercial agreements to ensure appropriate treatment and contractual alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive systems transformation &amp;amp; integrations:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the accounting design for supply chain and fixed asset systems and integrations, including ERP implementations, migrations, or upgrades (e.g., NetSuite to Tier-1 platforms like SAP or Oracle), as well as sub-ledger and procurement/WMS integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner across the business:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a trusted advisor to Operations, Supply Chain, Procurement, FP&amp;amp;A, IT, Tax, Treasury, and Senior Leadership. Partner closely with FP&amp;amp;A on annual budgets, forecasts, and capital planning strategies to fix data at the source and ensure accurate, timely information flow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead audit readiness &amp;amp; operational excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary liaison with external auditors and Internal Audit to ensure timely, accurate deliverables. Continuously review existing processes to simplify, automate, shorten close timelines, and reduce operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and scale a global team:&lt;/strong&gt; Start as a hands-on player-coach, then hire, mentor, and grow a high-performing global team from a lean starting point.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
