&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an Engineering Manager to lead a team within our build, test, and deploy platform organization, which powers CI/CD for CoreWeave engineering. This role blends hands-on technical judgment with people leadership - you&#39;ll guide your team&#39;s execution on continuous integration (CI), build systems, artifact management and release automation, while partnering closely with senior engineers and technical leads on day-to-day design and operational decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be accountable for your team&#39;s health and execution, translating broader platform strategy into concrete, achievable work for your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
