&lt;li&gt;Uphold standards for reliability, performance, and security within your team&#39;s scope, balancing high-availability requirements with developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break down roadmap priorities into clear, actionable plans for your team, and track relevant business metrics (e.g. CI reliability, build time, artifactory latency).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage day-to-day execution, including technical debt tradeoffs and unblocking your team to hit measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow and support your team members directly - regular 1:1s, mentorship, and fostering ownership and collaboration within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Investing in our people is one of our top priorities, and we value candidates who can bring their diversified experiences to our teams. Here are some qualities we&#39;ve found compatible with our team. We&#39;d love to talk about whether this aligns with your experience and interests and what you&#39;re excited to work on next.&lt;/p&gt;
