&lt;li&gt;Background in regulated or security-sensitive environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with DORA metrics and delivery performance measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to supply-chain security and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing engineers in a distributed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
