&lt;li&gt;You are driven to solve complex low-latency systems challenges and scale top-tier engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are eager to push the boundaries of GPU optimization, next-generation distributed systems and massive-scale AI infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an expert in cloud storage, file and block and object storage systems and low-level systems programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
