&lt;li&gt;You communicate effectively and work well across cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a dynamic, fast-paced environment and can flex as priorities shift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re passionate about technology and eager to learn about the latest advancements in cloud compute services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
