&lt;li&gt;Big 4 public accounting experience; CPA or CMA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wondering if you&#39;re a good fit? We believe in investing in our people and value candidates who can bring their diverse experiences to our teams — even if you aren&#39;t a 100% skill or experience match. Here are a few qualities we&#39;ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we&#39;d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
