&lt;li&gt;Ability to troubleshoot hardware and software issues and perform system maintenance tasks consistently and reliably&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software development or scripting languages (bash, python, powershell, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 + years of experience troubleshooting or administering data center or on-prem infrastructure (servers, storage, network or a mix)&lt;/li&gt;
