&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Curious, agile, and energized by the pace and ambiguity of a high-growth company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
