&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Relentless problem solver who traces discrepancies to the source, fixes root causes, and implements controls to prevent recurrence.&lt;/p&gt;
