&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;31:1-31:81;3481-3561&quot;&gt;Prior experience in a high-growth technology, cloud, or infrastructure company&lt;/li&gt;
