&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Security Products&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Security Products is building the systems that make CoreWeave trustworthy at scale. You will have the opportunity to lead a team responsible for foundational capabilities that protect access to cloud resources, enable secure product experiences, and support customers running critical AI workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact leadership role for an engineering manager who wants to shape both the technology and the organization behind a modern cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
