&lt;li&gt;5+ years of leading design or architecture (design patterns, reliability and scaling) of new and existing systems experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a mentor, tech lead or leading an engineering team including coding standards, code reviews, source control management, build processes, testing, and operations experience&lt;/li&gt;
