&lt;p&gt;This is a highly visible and impactful&amp;nbsp; staff-level role: you will translate complex immigration and mobility requirements into clear decisions, repeatable processes, strong vendor governance, and an excellent employee and candidate experience. You will also lead and develop one Global Mobility team member as the function scales across the US, EMEA, and APAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Program strategy and governance&lt;/p&gt;
