&lt;li&gt;Build scalable workflows across Workday, Greenhouse, Asana, case-management tools, and vendor platforms; define system ownership, data standards, and handoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate global mobility trackers and reporting, including case volume, cycle time, spend, aging, outcomes, escalations, and upcoming compliance milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to automate intake, status updates, document collection, employee communications, and leadership reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish documentation, controls, and audit-ready records for immigration and mobility processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Stakeholder partnership and team leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
