&lt;li&gt;Coach, prioritize, and develop the Global Mobility team member; create clarity on ownership, service levels, and quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with global benefits, payroll, EOR, immigration, relocation, and local-market partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
