&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;39:1-39:90;5082-5171&quot;&gt;You&#39;re curious about where every dollar moves—and how to make it move more efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;40:1-40:117;5172-5288&quot;&gt;You thrive on tackling complex operational challenges and implementing lasting solutions that address root causes.&lt;/li&gt;
