&lt;p&gt;In this collaborative role, you&#39;ll work closely with the Storage Team, leveraging their technical expertise to innovate and enhance our storage products. Your role is critical in ensuring that our storage solutions not only integrate seamlessly with the unique demands of AI workloads but also lead the market in performance, reliability, and scalability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
