&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Product Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with engineering teams to design, build, and launch storage solutions and features that are scalable, secure, and cost-effective. Ensure that products meet high standards of quality and performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the voice of the customer within the organization. Gather and prioritize customer requirements and feedback to continuously improve the product.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
