&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As a Sr. Salesforce Administrator, you will own the administration, optimization, and scalability of Salesforce and related GTM technologies that support Sales, Marketing, Customer Success, and Revenue Operations. You will partner closely with cross-functional stakeholders to design and implement scalable solutions, improve operational efficiency, and drive user adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
