&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;Wondering if you’re a good fit?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams – even if you aren&#39;t a 100% skill or experience match. Here are a few qualities we’ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we’d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0,0&quot;&gt;You love to &lt;strong&gt;leverage cutting-edge GenAI tools&lt;/strong&gt; (like Cursor, Claude, or Copilot) to accelerate your own development, testing, and documentation processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;21,1,0&quot;&gt;You’re curious about &lt;strong&gt;designing solutions with user experience (UX)&lt;/strong&gt; and long-term system maintainability as a top priority.&lt;/li&gt;
