&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;25,2,0&quot;&gt;Empower Employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;25,3,0&quot;&gt;Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences&lt;/li&gt;
