&lt;li&gt;Proven track record with building customer relationships, communicating clearly and the ability to break down complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with NVIDIA GPUs typically used in AI/ML applications and associated technologies including networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of&amp;nbsp; administrating Kubernetes clusters&amp;nbsp; including controls such as RBAC, admission controllers, container security, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience describing security concepts clearly, along with best practices and an understanding of the security tooling landscape in Kubernetes environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
