&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;1:1-1:20;0-19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;3:1-3:575;21-595&quot;&gt;The Product Engineering organization is responsible for executing and delivering CoreWeave&#39;s products, platforms, processes, and tools. As a security technical program leader focused on enterprise security and Identity &amp;amp; Access Management (IAM), you will work across cross-functional teams—including security, IT, engineering, product, and operations—to ensure that access to our cloud infrastructure and enterprise systems is secure, governed, and least-privileged, while maintaining scalability and delivery of exceptional performance to meet the demands of our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:183;597-779&quot;&gt;If you are passionate about identity, access, and cloud security, thrive in complex technical environments, and excel at orchestrating large-scale programs, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;7:1-7:20;781-800&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-18:120;832-2148&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:262;832-1093&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end program management for critical enterprise security and IAM initiatives—including identity lifecycle management, access governance, authentication, and privileged access—across cross-functional planning, execution, delivery, and retrospectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-12:124;1094-1217&quot;&gt;Define program scope, milestones, and success metrics while managing security and identity-related risks and dependencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:183;1218-1400&quot;&gt;Partner closely within the security team, and across IT, engineering, product management and operations teams to ensure alignment on identity and access priorities and deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:166;1401-1566&quot;&gt;Act as the primary point of contact for security and cross-functional stakeholders, providing regular status updates, addressing risks, and ensuring accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:176;1567-1742&quot;&gt;Facilitate and influence technical discussions and decisions on identity, access, privacy and compliance to align with long-term infrastructure goals and business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;16:1-16:193;1743-1935&quot;&gt;Develop and implement scalable processes—such as access certification, joiner/mover/leaver workflows, and least-privilege reviews—to improve efficiency and predictability in program delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:93;1936-2028&quot;&gt;Strategically automate and improve day-to-day identity operations, processes and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;18:1-18:120;2029-2148&quot;&gt;Tailor communications to a diverse audience and remain adaptable to a wide range of personalities and technical depth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-20:17;2150-2166&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-29:189;2168-3727&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-22:231;2168-2398&quot;&gt;8+ years of hands-on Technical Program Management experience, with a strong focus on Identity and Access Management (IAM), enterprise security, or identity governance programs, ideally within the cloud services or SaaS industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-23:115;2399-2513&quot;&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s degree in Information Security, Computer Science, or a related field, or equivalent job experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-24:318;2514-2831&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience leading large-scale IAM initiatives—such as identity lifecycle management (joiner/mover/leaver), single sign-on (SSO), multi-factor authentication (MFA), privileged access management (PAM), role-/attribute-based access control (RBAC/ABAC), and access certification/recertification campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;25:1-25:272;2832-3103&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of core IAM and identity governance platforms and protocols (e.g., Okta, Microsoft Entra ID/Azure AD, SAML, OAuth 2.0, OIDC, SCIM, LDAP) and Zero Trust architecture principles and least-privilege access models across workforce and workload identities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:152;3104-3255&quot;&gt;Exceptional leadership, interpersonal, and influencing skills, with a proven ability to build relationships across technical and non-technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;27:1-27:135;3256-3390&quot;&gt;Proficiency in program management tools and methodologies (e.g., Jira, Google Sheets) with a focus on delivering measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
