&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;33:1-33:163;3365-3527&quot;&gt;You have worked at a cloud infrastructure provider, or in another fixed asset-heavy industry and are familiar with financing structures used in those industries&lt;/li&gt;
