&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1esdkn2&quot; data-start=&quot;1850&quot; data-end=&quot;1942&quot;&gt;Familiar with Kubernetes concepts and/or experienced administrating Kubernetes clusters.&lt;/li&gt;
