&lt;li&gt;You love to own complex infrastructure projects end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re curious about improving scalability, reliability, and design efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an expert in whitespace design, low-voltage systems, and network infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
