&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:239;1174-1412&quot;&gt;You bring 10+ years of hands-on experience in Platform Engineering, Infrastructure Engineering, or building highly scalable distributed systems — with a strong foundation in software design, development, and algorithmic problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-12:197;1413-1609&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Platform Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity operating data platforms or data-intensive workloads, including distributed processing and streaming frameworks such as Spark, Airflow, Kafka, or Flink.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:179;1610-1788&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes &amp;amp; Containerization:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep expertise in Kubernetes cluster design, day-to-day operations, and production troubleshooting across containerized service environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:135;1789-1923&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record building and operating robust CI/CD pipelines using tools such as Argo CD and GitHub Actions.&lt;/li&gt;
