&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;16:1-16:120;2167-2286&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Distributed Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience developing large-scale distributed systems, databases, and backend APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:224;2287-2510&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Region Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience designing and operating geo-replicated, active-active, multi-region systems — with a solid grasp of traffic routing, failover strategies, and data consistency tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
