&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-20:149;2869-3017&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Capacity:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong command of system performance tuning, capacity planning, and resource optimization in distributed environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:184;3018-3201&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud-Native Security:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience applying security best practices in cloud-native settings, including secrets management, network policies, and vulnerability scanning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
