&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;1:1-1:20;0-19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;3:1-3:450;21-470&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is seeking a highly skilled and motivated Systems Engineer, Legal Systems to build and scale our contract lifecycle management (CLM) and legal technology ecosystem, with a primary focus on Ironclad. In this role, you will partner closely with Legal, Legal Operations, Finance, Sales, GTM, Procurement, Security, and IT to design, implement, and optimize legal systems and workflows that support a fast-growing, complex organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:20;472-491&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;7:1-7:182;493-674&quot;&gt;You will play a critical role in streamlining contract processes, improving data visibility, and ensuring integrations across enterprise systems are secure, scalable, and compliant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-19:98;676-1938&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:135;676-810&quot;&gt;Own the administration, configuration, and optimization of Ironclad CLM, including workflows, templates, approvals, and permissions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;10:1-10:137;811-947&quot;&gt;Partner with Legal and Legal Operations stakeholders to translate contract and compliance requirements into scalable system solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:137;948-1084&quot;&gt;Design and maintain contract workflows across the full lifecycle, from intake and negotiation through execution, storage, and renewal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-12:134;1085-1218&quot;&gt;Build and support integrations between Ironclad and enterprise systems (e.g., CRM, ERP, procurement, billing, identity management).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:137;1219-1355&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain reports, dashboards, and analytics to support contract visibility, compliance tracking, and operational insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:116;1356-1471&quot;&gt;Manage system security, access controls, and data governance to ensure confidentiality and regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:79;1472-1550&quot;&gt;Support contract data migrations, system enhancements, and feature rollouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;16:1-16:108;1551-1658&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve system issues, partnering with Ironclad support and internal IT teams as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:89;1659-1747&quot;&gt;Create and maintain documentation and training materials for legal and business users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;18:1-18:93;1748-1840&quot;&gt;Support administration and integration of other legal systems – Descartes, Brightflag etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-19:98;1841-1938&quot;&gt;Stay current on Ironclad product enhancements, CLM trends, and legal technology best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:17;1940-1956&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-29:143;1958-2788&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-23:127;1958-2084&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Legal Operations, or a related field (or equivalent experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-24:153;2085-2237&quot;&gt;3+ years of experience supporting Legal Systems, CLM platforms, or enterprise workflow tools, with hands-on experience in Ironclad strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;25:1-25:98;2238-2335&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of contract lifecycle management processes and legal operations workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:100;2336-2435&quot;&gt;Experience configuring workflow automation, approvals, templates, and permissions in CLM systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;27:1-27:162;2436-2597&quot;&gt;Experience with GenAI driven automation and how AI agents or workflows can accelerate system migrations, data mapping, or support processes in a Legal context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;28:1-28:48;2598-2645&quot;&gt;Experience with system integrations and APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;29:1-29:143;2646-2788&quot;&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills, with the ability to partner effectively with legal and non-legal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
