&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a newly established team, this role will also be responsible for assisting in building out foundational documentation, including Desktop Procedures (DTPs), process flows, and job aids, to standardize how the team operates. This person will directly execute and manage vendor requests while assisting and leading our offshore resources, ensuring consistent quality and turnaround.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
